# Nexora Cloud Platform Configuration
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository

# Branch protection is enforced via GitHub UI:
# Settings → Branches → Branch protection rules

# Recommended settings for `main`:
# ✅ Require a pull request before merging
# ✅ Require status checks to pass: CI (lint, build, docker-build)
# ✅ Require conversation resolution before merging
# ✅ Require linear history
# ✅ Do not allow bypassing the above settings
